                                "sense_id": "253cecc3-30b3-367b-ad1c-6fca2123f261",
                                "text": "The zealous citizens would suspend their avocations for a while, would repeat a reverential prayer as the holy men went by, and then return to the absorbing calls of business, not unbenefited by the recollections just awakened in their minds."
                            },
                            {
